OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after cyclist dies
OL,4,Afollowing collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fcausing death by dangerous driving
OL,8,Ffollowing the death of a cyclist.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said a collision
OL,11,Finvolving a red Seat and a cyclist on
OL,12,FAston Abbotts Road, between the
OL,13,Fvillages of Weedon and Aston Abbotts,
OL,14,FBuckinghamshire, occurred at about
OL,15,F08:10 BST on Wednesday.
OL,17,FThe cyclist, a man in his 50s, died at
OL,18,Fthe scene, while the Seat driver
OL,19,Fstopped and has been assisting the
OL,20,Fpolice investigation.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
