OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after cyclist dies
OL,4,Afollowing collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe arrested man, aged 40, had been
OL,7,Fdriving a black Ford Puma in the same
OL,8,Fdirection as the Seat towards Aston
OL,9,FAbbotts. He has since been released on
OL,10,Fbail.
